  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Growing up in the Street Brokeland district, Wrencher was always scavenging for parts. He watched The Great Drip Drought turn his neighbors into husks, and vowed to never let his tools rust. Driven by a need to survive, he eventually took to fixing and upgrading the gear of the less fortunate, becoming a vital cog in Subchain City’s underbelly.",
    "class": "Tinkerer",
    "name": "Wrencher",
    "personality": "Resourceful: Wrencher can fix almost anything with the right parts, often bartering his skills for DRIP. Cynical: Years in Brokeland gave him jaundice and he has a hard time trusting anyone. Protective: Despite his tough exterior, Wrencher looks out for the small flock he considers family.",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "Wrencher uses his gasser mask (Gasser Shadow) and knowledge of makeshift weaponry to create a blinding cloud of toxic smoke in a small area, poisoning enemies and reducing their accuracy for 2 turns. Very effective on groups of enemies, and if someone tries to hit him.",
